<section class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 sm:p-6"><div><h2 class="text-lg font-bold">Kalender jadwalmu</h2><p class="mt-1 text-xs text-slate-500">Pilih tanggal untuk melihat sesi dan alat.</p></div><label><span class="sr-only">Bulan jadwal</span><input type="month" x-model="month" @change="load()" :disabled="loading" class="h-11 rounded-lg border border-slate-200 px-3 text-sm"></label></div><p x-show="loading" class="p-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Memuat jadwal…</p><div class="grid grid-cols-7 bg-slate-50"><template x-for="day in ['Sen','Sel','Rab','Kam','Jum','Sab','Min']"><div class="py-3 text-center text-xs font-semibold text-slate-500" x-text="day"></div></template></div><div class="grid grid-cols-7"><template x-for="cell in calendarCells" :key="cell.key"><div class="min-w-0 border-t border-r border-slate-100"><button type="button" x-show="cell.date" @click="selectedDate=cell.date" :aria-label="cell.date+(cell.attendance?', sudah masuk':'')" :aria-pressed="selectedDate===cell.date" :class="selectedDate===cell.date?'bg-brand-50 ring-2 ring-inset ring-brand-500':''" class="min-h-[88px] w-full p-2 text-left sm:min-h-[112px] sm:p-3"><span class="text-sm font-bold" x-text="Number(cell.date?.slice(-2))"></span><span class="mt-2 block text-[10px] sm:text-xs" :class="cell.attendance?'font-semibold text-brand-700':'text-slate-500'" x-text="cell.attendance?'Masuk':(cell.sessions?.length?cell.sessions.length+' sesi':'Libur')"></span><span x-show="cell.custom" class="mt-1 hidden text-[10px] text-indigo-600 sm:block">Khusus</span></button><span x-show="!cell.date" class="block min-h-[88px] bg-slate-50 sm:min-h-[112px]"></span></div></template></div></section>
<section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 sm:p-6"><h2 class="font-bold" x-text="dateLabel(selectedDate)"></h2><div class="mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2"><template x-for="session in selectedDay.sessions" :key="session.id"><div class="rounded-xl border border-slate-200 p-4"><p class="font-semibold" x-text="'Sesi '+session.id+' · '+session.tool"></p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500" x-text="session.start+'–'+session.end+' WITA'"></p></div></template></div><p x-show="!selectedDay.sessions.length" class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-500">Tidak ada sesi yang dijadwalkan untukmu.</p><template x-if="selectedAttendance"><div class="mt-4 border-t border-slate-100 pt-4 text-sm"><p>Masuk: <strong x-text="time(selectedAttendance.checked_in_at)"></strong></p><p class="mt-2 break-all text-slate-500" x-text="'GPS '+selectedAttendance.latitude+', '+selectedAttendance.longitude+' · akurasi ±'+Math.round(selectedAttendance.accuracy_m)+' m'"></p><a :href="mapUrl(selectedAttendance)" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="mt-3 inline-block text-brand-700 underline">Lihat lokasi ↗</a></div></template></section>
<p class="text-xs leading-5 text-slate-500">Lokasi hanya diminta ketika kamu menekan Masuk. Absensi dicatat sekali sehari dan tidak memerlukan checkout.</p>
